      "GraphEdge": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "近傍サブグラフ・パス探索の辺1本。\n\n**`Relationship`と別の型にする理由**: `Relationship`は「あるエンティティ\nから見た関係」なので`direction`(自分が主語か目的語か)を持つ。\nサブグラフの辺は**特定の視点を持たない**ので、代わりに`source`/`target`\n(どちらも完全IRI)で向きを表す。`direction`を流用すると「誰から見た\n向きなのか」が応答から読めなくなる。",
        "properties": {
          "graph": {
            "title": "Graph",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "predicate": {
            "title": "Predicate",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "source": {
            "title": "Source",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "target": {
            "title": "Target",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "source",
          "target",
          "predicate",
          "graph"
        ],
        "title": "GraphEdge",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "HTTPValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"
            },
            "title": "Detail",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "title": "HTTPValidationError",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "NeighborhoodResponse": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "近傍サブグラフ(仕様§9.1「指定ノードから深さ1-2のノード/エッジ」)。\n\n**既知の限界(観察O10)**: `LawRevision`(実データで9,550件)は\n**グラフの辺を1本も持たない** —— 法令への結びつきは`lawId`という\nリテラルとIRIのパスに埋まった法令IDだけで、辺として存在しない。\n**したがって法令の近傍に改正は一度も現れない。**\n利用者が「この法令の近傍にはこれしか無い」と読むのは誤りである\n(辺を足すのはPhase 2の課題)。**黙っていないためにここに書く**\n(このプロジェクトの再発欠陥6: 報告が嘘をつく)。",
        "properties": {
          "center": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntityRef"
          },
          "depth": {
            "title": "Depth",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "edge_limit": {
            "title": "Edge Limit",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "edges": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GraphEdge"
            },
            "title": "Edges",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "edges_truncated": {
            "title": "Edges Truncated",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "fanout_limit": {
            "title": "Fanout Limit",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "fanout_truncated_nodes": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "title": "Fanout Truncated Nodes",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "graphs": {
            "additionalProperties": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Provenance"
            },
            "title": "Graphs",
            "type": "object"
          },
          "node_limit": {
            "title": "Node Limit",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "nodes": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntityRef"
            },
            "title": "Nodes",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "nodes_truncated": {
            "title": "Nodes Truncated",
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "center",
          "depth",
          "nodes",
          "edges",
          "graphs",
          "node_limit",
          "edge_limit",
          "fanout_limit",
          "nodes_truncated",
          "edges_truncated",
          "fanout_truncated_nodes"
        ],
        "title": "NeighborhoodResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "PathResponse": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "パス探索(仕様§9.1「2エンティティ間の経路(法令↔法人など)」)。\n\n**`found=False`の読み方を応答の形で強制する。**\n「max_depth以内に経路が無かった」と「経路が存在しない」は違う ——\n空の結果だけを返すと利用者は後者だと読む(このプロジェクトが繰り返し\n重い欠陥として扱ってきた「報告が嘘をつく」型)。`exhaustive`が真で\n初めて後者を意味する。",
        "properties": {
          "budget_exhausted": {
            "title": "Budget Exhausted",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "depth_limited": {
            "title": "Depth Limited",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "edges": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GraphEdge"
            },
            "title": "Edges",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "exhaustive": {
            "title": "Exhaustive",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "fanout_limit": {
            "title": "Fanout Limit",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "fanout_truncated": {
            "title": "Fanout Truncated",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "found": {
            "title": "Found",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "goal": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntityRef"
          },
          "graphs": {
            "additionalProperties": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Provenance"
            },
            "title": "Graphs",
            "type": "object"
          },
          "max_depth": {
            "title": "Max Depth",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "nodes": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntityRef"
            },
            "title": "Nodes",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "searched_depth": {
            "title": "Searched Depth",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "start": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EntityRef"
          },
          "undirected": {
            "title": "Undirected",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "visit_budget": {
            "title": "Visit Budget",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "visited": {
            "title": "Visited",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "start",
          "goal",
          "nodes",
          "edges",
          "graphs",
          "found",
          "max_depth",
          "visit_budget",
          "visited",
          "searched_depth",
          "budget_exhausted",
          "depth_limited",
          "fanout_limit",
          "fanout_truncated",
          "exhaustive",
          "undirected"
        ],
        "title": "PathResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "Provenance": {
